  "answer_text": "It looks like there are several pools named \"Glenwood Pool\" across the United States! Here's a summary of the most notable ones:\n\n---\n\n### \ud83c\udfca 1. **Glenwood Hot Springs Pool** \u2013 Glenwood Springs, CO\nThe historic Glenwood Hot Springs Resort is home to the **world's largest hot springs pool**, with more than 7 expansive pools on the property. The historic thermal spring water has been drawing visitors from all over the world since 1888.\n\nThe source of the mineral water is the Yampah Spring, which produces over 3.5 million gallons of water per day at 122\u00b0F. Before entering the pools, it is cooled to 104\u00b0F for the Therapy Pool and further cooled to 90\u201393\u00b0F for the Grand Pool.\n\nThe Grand Pool contains over 1 million gallons of water and is an aquatic playground for kids of all ages, with plenty of room to spread out, plus a lap lane and diving area.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83c\udfca 2. **Glenwood Pool** \u2013 Forest Glen, Maryland\nGlenwood Pool is a **swim club** set back among the trees and along a creek in historic Forest Glen, Maryland. They welcome new members to join!\n\n---\n\n### \ud83c\udfca 3. **Glenwood Houses Pool** \u2013 Brooklyn, New York\nLocated in the Glenwood Houses neighborhood of Brooklyn, New York, the Glenwood Houses Pool offers a place to cool off and enjoy the water during hot New York summers. It is managed by NYC Parks.\n\nIt is located at Farragut Road & Ralph Avenue, and can be reached at (718) 531-2480.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83c\udfca 4. **Glenwood Aquatic Center** \u2013 Glenwood Springs, CO\nThis community aquatic center features a **277,000-gallon pool** with 8 lap lanes and a one-meter diving board. The pool ranges from 4 to 12 feet deep, with a temperature kept between 82\u201384\u00b0F.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83c\udfca 5. **Glennwood Pool** \u2013 Evans, Georgia\nGlennwood Pool is a **non-profit, volunteer-run neighborhood pool** in Evans, Georgia. They offer memberships for residents and non-residents, seasonal events like dive-in movie nights, and military & senior discounts.\n\n---\n\nCould you let me know which **Glenwood Pool** you're interested in, or what specific information you're looking for? I'm happy to help! \ud83d\ude0a",
